#: src/Command/Builtin.php:113
msgid "Does nothing, successfully"
msgstr "Tut nichts, und zwar erfolgreich"

#: src/Command/Builtin.php:116
msgid "Does nothing, unsuccessfully"
msgstr "Tut nichts, und zwar erfolglos"

#: src/Command/Builtin.php:119
msgid "A short tour of the terminal"
msgstr "Eine kurze Tour durchs Terminal"

#: src/Command/Builtin.php:121
msgid ""
"<accent>Welcome to snarkbash.</accent> A shell for a website. Yes, really."
msgstr ""
"<accent>Willkommen bei snarkbash.</accent> Eine Shell für eine Website. Ja, "
"wirklich."

#: src/Command/Builtin.php:123
msgid ""
"<comment>1. Move around</comment>  The site is a file system: pages are "
"folders."
msgstr ""
"<comment>1. Bewegen</comment>  Die Website ist ein Dateisystem: Seiten sind "
"Ordner."

#: src/Command/Builtin.php:124
msgid ""
"   <info>ls</info>  lists the pages here · <info>cd events</info>  walks in "
"· <info>cd ..</info>  walks out · <info>tree</info>  shows it all"
msgstr ""
"   <info>ls</info>  listet die Seiten hier · <info>cd events</info>  geht "
"hinein · <info>cd ..</info>  geht hinaus · <info>tree</info>  zeigt alles"

#: src/Command/Builtin.php:125
msgid ""
"   <info>cat events</info>  reads a page · <info>open events</info>  "
"actually goes there"
msgstr ""
"   <info>cat events</info>  liest eine Seite · <info>open events</info>  "
"geht tatsächlich hin"

#: src/Command/Builtin.php:127
msgid ""
"<comment>2. Be lazy</comment>  <info>Tab</info> completes commands and page "
"names. <info>↑</info> / <info>↓</info> bring back what you typed."
msgstr ""
"<comment>2. Sei faul</comment>  <info>Tab</info> vervollständigt Befehle und "
"Seitennamen. <info>↑</info> / <info>↓</info> holen zurück, was du getippt "
"hast."

#: src/Command/Builtin.php:128
msgid ""
"   <info>Ctrl+L</info> clears, <info>Ctrl+C</info> drops the line, "
"<info>Esc</info> leaves."
msgstr ""
"   <info>Ctrl+L</info> leert den Bildschirm, <info>Ctrl+C</info> verwirft "
"die Zeile, <info>Esc</info> geht raus."

#: src/Command/Builtin.php:130
msgid ""
"<comment>3. Combine</comment>  Pipes and lists work: <info>ls -l | grep "
"events</info>, <info>cd events && ls</info>, <info>echo hi; whoami</info>"
msgstr ""
"<comment>3. Kombinieren</comment>  Pipes und Listen funktionieren: <info>ls "
"-l | grep events</info>, <info>cd events && ls</info>, <info>echo hi; "
"whoami</info>"

#: src/Command/Builtin.php:131
msgid ""
"   Variables too: <info>export GREETING=hello</info> then <info>echo "
"$GREETING $USER</info>. Shortcuts: <info>alias ll=\"ls -l\"</info>"
msgstr ""
"   Variablen auch: <info>export GREETING=hallo</info>, dann <info>echo "
"$GREETING $USER</info>. Abkürzungen: <info>alias ll=\"ls -l\"</info>"

#: src/Command/Builtin.php:133
msgid ""
"<comment>4. Get help</comment>  <info>help</info> lists everything you may "
"run, <info>help <command></info> explains one."
msgstr ""
"<comment>4. Hilfe holen</comment>  <info>help</info> listet alles, was du "
"ausführen darfst, <info>help <command></info> erklärt einen Befehl."

#: src/Command/Builtin.php:134
msgid ""
"   Commands that are not for you answer with \"Permission denied\". Log in "
"and they may change their mind."
msgstr ""
"   Befehle, die nicht für dich sind, antworten mit „Keine Berechtigung“. "
"Melde dich an, vielleicht überlegen sie es sich dann anders."

#: src/Command/Builtin.php:136
msgid ""
"<comment>5. You</comment>  <info>login</info> signs you in right here, "
"<info>logout</info> out again. <info>whoami</info> if you forgot."
msgstr ""
"<comment>5. Du</comment>  <info>login</info> meldet dich gleich hier an, "
"<info>logout</info> wieder ab. <info>whoami</info>, falls du es vergessen "
"hast."

#: src/Command/Builtin.php:137
msgid ""
"   <info>login</info> takes your user name or your email address. Forgot the "
"password? <info>passwd <email></info> mails you a link."
msgstr ""
"   <info>login</info> nimmt deinen Benutzernamen oder deine E-Mail-Adresse. "
"Passwort vergessen? <info>passwd <email></info> schickt dir einen Link."

#: src/Command/Builtin.php:138
msgid "   No account yet? <info>register</info> creates one right here."
msgstr ""
"   Noch kein Konto? <info>register</info> erstellt dir gleich hier eins."

#: src/Command/Builtin.php:139
msgid ""
"   <info>lang de</info> switches the terminal to German, <info>lang en</"
"info> back. <info>attitude</info> sets how rude I am."
msgstr ""
"   <info>lang de</info> schaltet auf Deutsch, <info>lang en</info> zurück "
"auf Englisch. <info>attitude</info> bestimmt, wie frech ich bin."

#: src/Command/Builtin.php:143
msgid ""
"<comment>6. LAN</comment>  <info>events</info> what is coming, <info>next</"
"info> the countdown, <info>event <name></info> all about one."
msgstr ""
"<comment>6. LAN</comment>  <info>events</info> was ansteht, <info>next</"
"info> der Countdown, <info>event <name></info> alles über eines."

#: src/Command/Builtin.php:144
msgid ""
"   <info>easy</info> takes you through the whole signup step by step, no "
"commands needed."
msgstr ""
"   <info>easy</info> führt dich Schritt für Schritt durch die ganze "
"Anmeldung, ganz ohne Befehle."

#: src/Command/Builtin.php:146
msgid ""
"   <info>signup <id></info> gets you in, <info>seat</info> shows the plan "
"and takes one (<info>seat <event> <seat></info>), <info>signups</info> lists "
"yours."
msgstr ""
"   <info>signup <id></info> meldet dich an, <info>seat</info> zeigt den "
"Sitzplan und reserviert einen Platz (<info>seat <event> <platz></info>), "
"<info>signups</info> listet deine Anmeldungen."

#: src/Command/Builtin.php:147
msgid ""
"   After <info>login</info>: <info>signup <id></info> gets you in, "
"<info>seat</info> picks your seat, <info>signups</info> lists yours."
msgstr ""
"   Nach dem <info>login</info>: <info>signup <id></info> meldet dich an, "
"<info>seat</info> sucht dir einen Platz aus, <info>signups</info> listet "
"deine Anmeldungen."

#: src/Command/Builtin.php:149
msgid ""
"   <info>balance</info> shows your credit and open bills, <info>pay</info> "
"pays one online."
msgstr ""
"   <info>balance</info> zeigt dein Guthaben und offene Rechnungen, "
"<info>pay</info> bezahlt eine online."

#: src/Command/Builtin.php:151
msgid "   <info>participants</info> shows who is in and where they sit."
msgstr "   <info>participants</info> zeigt, wer dabei ist und wo alle sitzen."

#: src/Command/Builtin.php:155
msgid ""
"<comment>7. Look and fun</comment>  <info>theme amber</info>, <info>theme "
"green</info>, <info>theme matrix</info>, <info>theme blackout</info>, "
"<info>theme paper</info>."
msgstr ""
"<comment>7. Aussehen und Spaß</comment>  <info>theme amber</info>, "
"<info>theme green</info>, <info>theme matrix</info>, <info>theme blackout</"
"info>, <info>theme paper</info>."

#: src/Command/Builtin.php:156
msgid ""
"   <info>show <file-id></info> turns an image into ASCII art, <info>figlet "
"hello</info> writes big, <info>cowsay</info>, <info>fortune</info>, "
"<info>neofetch</info>."
msgstr ""
"   <info>show <datei-id></info> macht aus einem Bild ASCII-Art, <info>figlet "
"hallo</info> schreibt groß, <info>cowsay</info>, <info>fortune</info>, "
"<info>neofetch</info>."

#: src/Command/Builtin.php:158
msgid ""
"Want to write your own commands? It works like Concrete CLI commands: see "
"the package README."
msgstr ""
"Willst du eigene Befehle schreiben? Das funktioniert wie bei Concrete-CLI-"
"Befehlen: siehe README des Pakets."

#: src/Command/Builtin.php:164
